    <string name="privacy_who_title">Who we are</string>
    <string name="privacy_who">This app is made by wander wildwood, an independent developer: one person, not a company. That makes wander wildwood the data controller for anything the app itself handles, and that is very little: what you put in stays on this phone unless you send it somewhere yourself, and nothing comes to the developer.</string>
    <string name="privacy_contact_title">How to contact us</string>
    <string name="privacy_contact">Write to email@wanderthe.dev, about your data or anything else.</string>
    <string name="privacy_rights_title">Your rights</string>
    <string name="privacy_rights">Under the GDPR you can ask to see the data held about you, to have it corrected or deleted, to limit or object to its use, to take a copy with you, to withdraw consent, and to complain to a data protection authority. Since the app keeps what it stores only on your phone, you can do most of this yourself: clear the app\'s data in Android\'s settings, or uninstall the app.</string>
